{% comment %}
  Visitor map (ClustrMaps).

  Setup:
    1. Go to https://clustrmaps.com and enter your site URL:
       https://bangwayne.github.io
    2. Choose a widget style (Map or Globe) and copy the embed snippet
       it gives you (looks like: <script ... src="//clustrmaps.com/map_v2.js?d=XXXX..."></script>
       or an <a><img .../></a> badge).
    3. Paste that snippet between the two marker comments below.
    4. Set `enable_clustrmaps: true` in _config.yml.
{% endcomment %}
{% if site.enable_clustrmaps %}
  <div class="clustrmaps-container text-center mt-4 mb-3">
    <!-- >>> PASTE CLUSTRMAPS SNIPPET BELOW THIS LINE <<< -->

    <!-- >>> PASTE CLUSTRMAPS SNIPPET ABOVE THIS LINE <<< -->
  </div>
{% endif %}
